{"id":224706,"title":"结课测试｜这些持续交付的相关知识，你都掌握了吗？","content":"<p>你好，我是王潇俊。</p><p>《持续交付36讲》这门课程已经全部结束了。我给你准备了一个结课小测试，来帮助你检验自己的学习效果。</p><p>这套测试题共有 20 道题目，包括10道单选题和10道多选题，满分 100 分，系统自动评分。</p><p>还等什么，点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=105&exam_id=222\"><img src=\"./images/224706_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":373935,"user_name":"怀揣梦想的学渣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1916685,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"2349B9F4F6FDE3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/3f/0d/1e8dbb2c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1683361837,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100009701,"comment_content":"很期望可以定期更新","like_count":0}]}